uestion/is-example false :question/problem "Find where the tangent to the curve $y=4{x}^{3}-9x-1$ at the point $(1,-6)$ intersects the $x$-axis." :question/worked-solution "Let $f(x)=4{x}^{3}-9x-1.$ Let's first calculate the derivative:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x)=\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4{x}^{3}-9x-1)=12{x}^{2}-9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the slope of the tangent at our point is\n\n$$\nm={f}^{′}(-1)=12(1)^{2}-9=3.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation of the tangent is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y-{y}_{1} & =m(x-{x}_{1}) \\\\ y-(-6) & =3(x-1) \\\\ y & =3x-3-6 \\\\ y & =3x-9.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find where the tangent line intercepts the $x$-axis, we set $y=0$ and solve:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}0 & =3x-9 \\\\ x & =3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the intersection point is $(3,0).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-103325/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "84c8ba29-95c9-5494-be0b-9b67bee6e45c"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-103325"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-103330/selection/566c033cc670f2eeb576d333926890b0dcdb71cae9a92ce2d64ad76e8173074e" :answer/id #uuid "b56b3db9-3b08-5e9a-8ae2-9334633190a6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(4,0)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103330/selection/85cb4fac0396602d43dca2c00e3ca71b29816b8e6c6a13d1cfa7f3ced25f7b78" :answer/id #uuid "21274d73-c7e6-5b19-a31d-07ef6ad7bce1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(0,2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103330/selection/a8d21c191bb52f35e36b7998de659bcfd3f034bae56d7de9f7b5454525c340d2" :answer/id #uuid "3a50d0a7-494a-521e-8d82-403fd3700358" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(0,4)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103330/selection/66de7ff1b7cbf574d42b7bd40f9ad0ac12b5f01e0beb69f180f89bdfcac40c0b" :answer/id #uuid "81ef8e88-12ef-5f26-ad9f-6232ea565e9a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(0,-8)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103330/selection/0e8402e9b725ef295a9ed9eb1eb4a7a8fcabc57d8aeab0f79b94530802afeb50" :answer/id #uuid "16894b12-8016-54ca-ab59-24359eb0ac4e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(0,-10)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103330/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "6ffea135-9731-54b8-9a0b-6fe63fc0fc7a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-103330/selection/66de7ff1b7cbf574d42b7bd40f9ad0ac12b5f01e0beb69f180f89bdfcac40c0b" :answer-field/choices ["q-103330/selection/566c033cc670f2eeb576d333926890b0dcdb71cae9a92ce2d64ad76e8173074e" "q-103330/selection/85cb4fac0396602d43dca2c00e3ca71b29816b8e6c6a13d1cfa7f3ced25f7b78" "q-103330/selection/a8d21c191bb52f35e36b7998de659bcfd3f034bae56d7de9f7b5454525c340d2" "q-103330/selection/66de7ff1b7cbf574d42b7bd40f9ad0ac12b5f01e0beb69f180f89bdfcac40c0b" "q-103330/selection/0e8402e9b725ef295a9ed9eb1eb4a7a8fcabc57d8aeab0f79b94530802afeb50"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-103330" :question/id #uuid "23e73676-f861-5219-9ebb-4274bb45201f" :question/math-academy-id "q-103330" :question/is-example false :question/problem "Find where the tangent to the curve $y=2{x}^{5}-8x$ at the point $(1,-6)$ intersects the $y$-axis." :question/worked-solution "Let $f(x)=2{x}^{5}-8x.$ Let's first calculate the derivative:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2{x}^{5}-8x)=10{x}^{4}-8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the slope of the tangent at our point is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m={f}^{′}(1)=10(1)^{4}-8=2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation of the tangent is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y-{y}_{1} & =m(x-{x}_{1}) \\\\ y+6 & =2(x-1) \\\\ y & =2x-2-6 \\\\ y & =2x-8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find where the tangent line intercepts the $y$-axis, we set $x=0$ and solve:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =2(0)-8 \\\\ y & =-8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the point of intersection is $(0,-8).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-103330/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "84c8ba29-95c9-5494-be0b-9b67bee6e45c"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-103330"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-103331/selection/f30fb0f59fafb6752d784950cc322d7f2032f94280c61093320bd35b48f74686" :answer/id #uuid "c0086013-72b6-5206-89f0-112a34476876" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(0,-3)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103331/selection/92ceb4efdc0cd986fcf6d914c334e6bc24d60c60afe74f5d1910588d4d342e77" :answer/id #uuid "e4468690-aef0-58ba-bd1a-11f5fdcdd7d3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(0,5)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103331/selection/a8d21c191bb52f35e36b7998de659bcfd3f034bae56d7de9f7b5454525c340d2" :answer/id #uuid "ae21f5c4-322c-5322-bfd4-e2146d243983" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(0,4)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103331/selection/c7d7f5865a04f287adfbc7ccac92458329d02c053e1fa27cc0df187ff8f49c48" :answer/id #uuid "9b5f3e0b-415e-5493-8ce4-2f13d2d4e951" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(0,-4)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103331/selection/ba1b6931d252bd6ad3d981dda2961a354b5f20b73d1e92201b84bb245e1b0bf9" :answer/id #uuid "9cef949a-216e-53ee-9af9-b0ad6d748144" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(5,0)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103331/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "c77a34ae-3041-55a0-b542-0963f7483402" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-103331/selection/92ceb4efdc0cd986fcf6d914c334e6bc24d60c60afe74f5d1910588d4d342e77" :answer-field/choices ["q-103331/selection/f30fb0f59fafb6752d784950cc322d7f2032f94280c61093320bd35b48f74686" "q-103331/selection/92ceb4efdc0cd986fcf6d914c334e6bc24d60c60afe74f5d1910588d4d342e77" "q-103331/selection/a8d21c191bb52f35e36b7998de659bcfd3f034bae56d7de9f7b5454525c340d2" "q-103331/selection/c7d7f5865a04f287adfbc7ccac92458329d02c053e1fa27cc0df187ff8f49c48" "q-103331/selection/ba1b6931d252bd6ad3d981dda2961a354b5f20b73d1e92201b84bb245e1b0bf9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-103331" :question/id #uuid "a99d54b3-32e8-5d50-8e14-b10454b82269" :question/math-academy-id "q-103331" :question/is-example false :question/problem "Find where the tangent to the curve $y=\\frac{1}{x}+3$ at the point $(1,4)$ intersects the $y$-axis." :question/worked-solution "Let $f(x)=\\frac{1}{x}+3.$ Let's first calculate the derivative:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{1}{x}+3)=-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the slope of the tangent at our point is\n\n$$\nm={f}^{′}(1)=-\\frac{1}{(1)^{2}}=-1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation of the tangent is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y-{y}_{1} & =m(x-{x}_{1}) \\\\ y-4 & =-(x-1) \\\\ y & =-x+1+4 \\\\ y & =5-x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find where the tangent line intercepts the $y$-axis, we set $x=0$ and solve:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =5-0 \\\\ y & =5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the point of intersection is $(0,5).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-103331/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "84c8ba29-95c9-5494-be0b-9b67bee6e45c"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-103331"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
